     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nDear all,</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nwe have just updated the Hierarchical Modeling landing page which is meant to give a concise and informative overview of our Hierarchical Modeling in Ecology projects. Please see here:\r\n<font face=\"Tahoma\"><font face=\"Tahoma\"><font face=\"Tahoma\"><a href=\"http://www.hierarchicalmodels.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.hierarchicalmodels.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792493916838000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2trywZ2iy3wNdei679OuU6\">www.hierarchicalmodels.com</a></font></font></font>.</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nMajor new things are:</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span>Fully updated links for the new book on Integrated Population Models (IPMs; due just before Christmas ...\r\n<span>🙂</span> ....). There are links to two Github pages that contain all the code in the book and more (big thanks to Mike Meredith for that).</span></li><li><span>We have a new section called &quot;Web tutorials&quot;. Right now it features Mike Meredith&#39;s superbly useful introduction to JAGS for wildlife researchers; check it out soon.</span></li><li><span>Finally, we have added a section entitled &quot;Hierarchical models in action....&quot;, where you can download (for FREE !) an English pdf of the latest Swiss Breeding Bird Atlas which (we hope) is a nice advertisement for binomial N-mixture and site-occupancy\r\n models applied in a large-scale SDM project.</span></li></ul>\r\n<div>One major thing still missing is that we must soon update/create short websites for the two AHM books .... first things on our list towards the end of this year.</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>*** Many thanks to Jim Hines from Patuxent for maintaining the website ***<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Best regards  --- Marc and colleagues<br>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n"
